sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Pet as Pet.vue（webview）
    participant App as App（app.go）
    participant Svc as service.Service
    participant DB as SQLite

    Note over Pet: 挂载时 & 每 4s 轮询（沿用 PET_SETTINGS_POLL_MS）
    Pet->>App: GetPetGrowth()
    App->>Svc: GetPetGrowth()
    Svc->>Svc: activeProgress(now, today)（与 GetTodayStats 共用）
    Svc->>DB: ActiveScenario / ListReminders / completedByReminder
    DB-->>Svc: 启用提醒 + 今日完成数
    Svc->>Svc: growthTier(done, target)
    Svc-->>App: PetGrowth{done_total, target_total, growth}
    App-->>Pet: PetGrowth
    Pet->>Pet: growth → class pet--growth-N

    Note over Pet: 用户在气泡点「完成」
    Pet->>App: CompleteReminder(fireID)
    App->>Svc: CompleteReminder(fireID)
    Svc->>DB: 事务：落终态 + 追加 CheckIn
    App-->>Pet: ok
    App-->>Pet: Emit reminder:changed(reason=check_in)
    Pet->>Pet: refreshPending() + refreshGrowth()
    Pet->>App: GetPetGrowth()
    App-->>Pet: PetGrowth（新档位，可能跨到 4）

    Note over Pet: 次日凌晨翻篇（无事件）
    Pet->>App: GetPetGrowth()（下一轮 4s 轮询）
    App-->>Pet: PetGrowth{growth: 0}（date_key 自然归零）
